{"server":"cn","storyId":"act25side_level_act25side_10_end","groupId":"act25side","stageId":"act25side_10","title":"散于星辰之间","storyCode":"CW-10","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act25side/level_act25side_10_end.txt","sourceHash":"6390460ede30652ab27a0bfe2c311c2531f11fd2836c37caa34258076e57895f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"亘古的双月露出真容。今夜，真实终于被人类首次窥见。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g7_arc_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g6_arc"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g7_arc_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g6_arc"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g7_arc_on"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g6_arc"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g7_arc_on"},{"type":"narration","text":"星星与大地相撞。\n满地洁白的碎屑中，一个人抬起头来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了总辖？你比以前退步了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你这一下没能杀我，我就要还击了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别眨眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"被塞雷娅击落的星星们重新浮起，形成全新的轨道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"克丽斯腾的手指划向一侧。\n塞雷娅的双脚突然变得重若千钧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"引力......变化？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你用这一招送走了缪尔赛思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这对我无效。"},{"type":"narration","text":"珐琅质在塞雷娅的脚下生长，就像一双沉重的靴子，将她钉在原地。\n随后，是一点点地前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有再提升钙质化对粒子的重构精密度，而是大幅度提升了释放速度。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你生成的珐琅质甚至变得更脆弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"强硬地对抗......并不足以走到终点。"},{"type":"narration","text":"一颗金属星球突破了珐琅质的屏障，砸中了塞雷娅的肩膀。\n塞雷娅没有停下脚步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"第二颗，第三颗。\n塞雷娅越走越快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停下，塞雷娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“停下”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这句话我对你说过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以告诉你我全部的计划......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你为何还要阻止我？这次计划里并不会出现更多的牺牲者。我只不过......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过......想在特里蒙上空放一朵无害的烟花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在聚焦完成的那一刻，军方和梅兰德就会松一口气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特里蒙的居民会在瞬间被天空的异象吸引，但很快又会被其他更值得关注的事情抓走注意力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱茵生命......或许是受影响最大的一方。莱茵会失去她的总辖，可能还有几名主任，以及哥伦比亚权力机构的信任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你更应该留在地面上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收拾残局，保护那些可能因这件事受伤的人，带着我们的莱茵渡过难关。你向来做得很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又忘了，我早就......辞职了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多像布莱克一样的人喜欢把科学家叫作“疯子”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可科学本该是理性的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾，当我第一次听你说起你父母的故事，我就产生了一个想法......他们不应该仅仅拥有那样的结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是他们没有死在那场事故里，而是在撞上阻隔层之前就返航......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那他们带给人们的，将是无比珍贵的数据，以及下一次探索的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我敬佩他们的意志与决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我从来都无法赞同理所当然的牺牲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"斐尔迪南，娜斯提，帕尔维斯......他们很多人都以为我过于保守。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们认为我拘泥于规则，始终都在阻挠你们前进。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈......“这样的人也配被称作科学家吗？”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至连我自己......都这样问过我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我认识的最执着于真理的人之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......真理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真理是出于一种追逐秩序的惯性。我相信科学带来真理，真理将约束人们的疯狂，为人类带来更好的秩序。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对瓦伊凡来说，受本能驱使的疯狂几乎伴随了种族的整段历史。暴力，蛮荒......我们花了很长时间，才走出那片混乱的黑暗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我从小到大所接受的教育。我以理性约束自身，并且拼命地......想要对抗那些我在你们身上看到的疯狂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是你做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，你想要一个人拉住莱茵生命，注定只会失望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因为人类对前进的渴望本就不可战胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一种欲望，一种“疯狂”，可也是生命的本能，是我们从一无所有的荒野里走到此时此地的燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我来到这里，并非为了对抗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉重的星星们如落石般砸向她，引力操控着气流在她周身呼啸。\n钙质结晶从头到脚一点点碎裂，但登山者决心以血肉之躯迎接风暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾，在找你的途中，我差点就承认了自己的失败。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到有人对我说，我需要找回源头。于是在来这里的路上，我回顾了......我们所有人的起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，我畏惧失控，其实并非是畏惧混乱，而是畏惧混乱导致的倒退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我必须前进，人类必须前进。因为对我们而言，跋涉远未结束。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，时至今日，人类依然生活在黑夜里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟......我们就连头顶的天幕都看不穿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路还很长，很长很长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们比旁人掌握了更多知识，就必须扛起更大的责任。我们该走在其他人前面，为他们排除危难，领着他们小心翼翼地往前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真正的先驱者，应当为全人类开道，而不是率先跳进深渊，有去无回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我的源头，我要确保的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抓到你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"她跨过了银河，穿过了风暴。\n最后的钙质结晶从一个人的掌心蔓延到另一个人的手背，金属制成的外骨骼操作系统震颤起来。\n人造的星星们一同围绕着两人旋转不息。\n周遭事物因法术相碰湮灭的余波陷入混乱。\n唯独保守者的意志似大地般永不动摇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_sanatorium_balcony"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你总是会迟到那么一小会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你总是会提前那么一小会，凯尔希。等了很久吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不算太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我想过接下来会是你。尽管在乌萨斯发生过很多事情，但你就像是个缩影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我很抱歉，真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉？为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我和我的丈夫在研究所做出决定的时候，我们就注定无法善终了。你也不是个多愁善感的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不，也许这一百年开始，你确实变得多愁善感了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"关于你们的事，我有遗憾，甚至有过懊悔，但并不是那么悲哀的情绪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我是说你的女儿。亚叶并没有如你所愿地生活在一个更好的时代，一个忘记仇恨、忘记暴力的时代。柳德米拉也是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我说过，你就像是一个缩影，莉莉娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你和亚叶，这种仇恨和血缘凝结成的不可破除的纽带，就像是一个缩影。我见过太多次了，徒劳的毁灭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听上去，你累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也不是被当作救世主创造出来的。你不能用一根手指头移平一座山，你也不能只靠眼神就毁灭城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......到底是哪些庸人才会从暴力的角度希望你无可战胜？难道这群傻子以为，靠暴力就能维护一个摇摇欲坠的文明？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......有些人也许这么希望过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我能带给他们未来。希望在我的国家生存。希望在我的麾下获胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你辜负了他们。因为你只是凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们的谈话得不出答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。你承认了，你累了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么呢？你总是走在避免他们自我毁灭的道路上......可你的力量是多么渺小啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有办法一瞬间从维多利亚抵达乌萨斯，你没办法监控大地上的每一个萨卡兹是否在钻研什么极端危险的巫术体系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你所做的越来越接近于杯水车薪，所以你开始有些焦躁了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"特别是在——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......你明知道自己害怕什么，却还能控制住自己不去想它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不让特蕾西娅和特雷西斯出现在你的面前，甚至是你潜意识里的哀求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......而同样出自你的意志，凯尔希，你觉得有人会温柔待你，所以那对兄妹不会以这样的方式与你对话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是奇特。你曾是多么冰冷，我曾以为你根本不奢求他人的温柔。从这个角度来说，你确实变得软弱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"春寒料峭，待在这里，我都要着凉了。我们需要去一个温暖如春的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莉莉娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_168_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们进去吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"24_g2_temple_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雪......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？外来者，稀奇。你是向圣山去的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么年轻的朝圣者很少能抵达这个位置，你怎么不走了？太冷冻伤了脚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"圣山，这里是谢拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢拉格？那是哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是你的家乡吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不算是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那是泰拉最壮观的雪山之一。我曾目睹着一群流离失所的难民抵达那里，在那片没有天灾的乐土整顿生息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，那一定是个美好的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泰拉......听着多渺小哇。你来自那里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......我来自泰拉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到圣山去。我们从出生开始，就只有这一个目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"从出生开始？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们童年时在留有青苔的平原上与树木嬉戏，向岩石学习，步入青壮之后，便要开始着手攀登高山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要在山脚做很多准备呢，例如把晨曦一缕一缕拧成绳索，或是准备一双不被黑夜沾染的鞋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而后我们便开始登山。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"道阻且长，我们只能取材自山谷之间，所幸圣山仁慈，它用死亡喂养我们，而我们将漫长的一生贡献给这条山路，以作回报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"走到这里，一定是一段辛苦的旅途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦？不不不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雪也不会为融化感到悲哀。这一切都是他者的自作多情，而我们只是攀登。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这座圣山叫什么？我又如何称呼您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这座山名唤“时间”，而我们？我们只是渺小的生命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间总是伟大的，不是吗？你应该最清楚不过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"山会改变吗？有人抵达过顶峰吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道。我不知道的意思就是——也许会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"试着对时间的空谷呼喊吧。你得到的回应就是圣山的恩赐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是什么无意义的举动，时间不会主动回答，但时间会做出回应。前人将这种回应称之为“命运”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"命运就是生命向时间呼号的回声。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有这么做过吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......看来今晚是个风雪交加的夜晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得准备晚餐了，还得找个扎营的地方......需要找地方歇脚吗？小姑娘，我们可以一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好......老先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，这里有什么可以果腹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也许吃的是“绝望”，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚餐前，也许你可先完成祷告。在风雪遮掩视线之前，呼喊吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"朝拜的老者","speakerId":"avg_npc_279_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大声点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g16_hugebone"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你将成为你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希。你的判断是理性的。我为此，感到抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么要道歉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我自己......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"因为我就是你的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一手造就了你对人类的不信任、你的悲观、你的茫然、你的焦躁与无可奈何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是......但是从她和她的身上，你看到了一种可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"出于谨慎且多虑的性格，你怀疑这种感情只是因为急躁而产生的误判......毕竟世界正在脱离你的认知与掌握。而新的你才刚诞生不久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你已经无数次想过，如果选择相信那些人，你会变得轻松许多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——我是你的时间。凯尔希，无所不知的痴愚啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巨大的尸骨","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你忘记了一些细小的细节，你不是天选的救世主。你不应是天选的救世主。你也不总是对的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你其实已经下定了决心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你比谁都清楚时间有限的程度。真的不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你该选择放手一搏。你该选择信任你可以信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你并非因为是“凯尔希”而被人信任，也并非受人信任才成为了“凯尔希”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是一个山谷的回响，穿岩的水滴。你肩负着远超你能力的责任，而如今，总算有人能为你分担这些责任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在这短短的几百年时间里，你失去的和获得的，超过以往那漫长到只能用来进化和演变的岁月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一切都要迎来结局了，凯尔希，你深知如此。你还是这么被动，这么悲观，这么无所作为吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别忘了你最初的问题。别忘了你险些得出的那个答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“生命”","speakerId":"avg_npc_603_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走下去。AMa-10。你存在的意义远超你自身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"............"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......到此为止吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"确实......足够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g8_storage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......他在别处冷静。我也确实想与你独处片刻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我有个疑问，AMa-10，凯尔希。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一万余年......你切实地活在这片大地上吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看上去，你变化颇大。虽然我们并无太多交集，但你可不该是今天的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你选择了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过数千年的战争，国家兴起，诸国并立，人们在隔阂与冲突中变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......但最终，它们皆如萨尔贡的黄沙般随风逝去。可转眼之间，历史又诞下了新的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我见过太多次循环。这种循环本身伟大而厚重，但我深知时间紧迫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而后，我邂逅了一次绝无仅有的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"曾有两位提卡兹人，比任何一个时代的任何一个生物，都更能接近文明存续的真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可你们如今脆弱得像是小行星带上的垃圾，谈何存续——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——等等。你是说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那顶黑色王冠还遗落在泰拉之上？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“魔王”。古老的提卡兹人如此称呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"提卡兹......人？那些千奇百怪的本土生物？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"竟然如此侥幸，我本以为它早已遗落在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......黑色的王冠。我并不喜欢它在物质界表露出的形状，王冠？恶趣味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"王冠意味着王权。这一古老的意象意味着权力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在这至今仍不断分崩离析，意识形态与种族的隔阂将地表文明推向自我毁灭的趋向里，在这和平与团结皆为奢望的幻影里——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"最直接的方式应当是利用那些力量，去重塑全部生灵的意志，将他们融为一体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只靠记忆、情感与知识塑造出一位虚假的领袖，又能做到什么？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不要小看阿米娅。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"不要小看罗德岛。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"不要小看我们。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"只是稍微喘口气......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"这玩意也太邪乎了......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是否小看你们，不影响既定的结局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你要我相信，小小的传承真的足以改变命运？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"从古老的祖先学会使用工具与火至今，人类唯一的壮举即是“传承”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"知识，文化，历史。所谓文明，不过如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"终有一天，黑色的王冠将不再属于阿米娅一人。而我们会为了存续而战，无论敌人是谁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你选择为泰拉而战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的选择吗？以这副身体，以这个身份？你与克丽斯腾以及她的族群并非同类。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们的奋斗......与你们的初衷相去甚远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使对于罗德岛预备行动组的干员来说，他们也知晓，为自己而战和为他人而战的区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们都做好了准备，泰拉这片大地是我所生长的大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我是罗德岛的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"行驶在泰拉大地上的，那艘船舶上的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......“感染者”只是一个过于微不足道的命题......但......感染者......源石吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“博士”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......我是罗德岛的一员。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是罗德岛的一员。","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我是罗德岛的一员......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我同样有一个疑问，特雷弗·弗里斯顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的时间是怎样的，在这......同样漫长的时间里？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g7_arc_on"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“波骇”系统解除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾，告诉我停止聚能的方法。能源究竟是从哪里来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这是一个很长的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我会争取在听完之前破解万星园的主控面板。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，你知道的，这片大地的历史......远比大多数人所知更漫长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我相信，每个时代都会有像我和我父母一样的怀疑者诞生。我们的探索真的从来都一无所获吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......是否存在一个更久远的时间点，那时候的天幕还不是现在我们看到的样子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我记得。这是莱茵科考科成立的最初目的之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是常规的勘探，就已经为我提供了许多有趣的信息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你离开莱茵生命之后，我又重拾了一些过去的兴趣，尝试着离开实验室，前往各个人们很少踏足的角落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些旅途的目的并非为了观测天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"星星们并不值得观测——我早就在无数次的计算中得出了这个结论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是......想试着找到更多合作者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......自从最后一个莱塔尼亚的法术探测球在阻隔层之下五百米坠落，各国学界都几乎放弃了针对阻隔层的研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我要找的......是并不属于这个时代的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......依赖源石技艺而跳脱生命约束的长生者们，还是那些古老到胜过国家的巨兽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许比这些被许多人奉为神祇的生命还要久远，久到已经被历史遗忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我出发之前，我并不能预料自己将会找到什么。我只是......感受到了某种呼唤，跨越时间与空间，指引着我走到那扇门前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"门里......有什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到了所有疑问的答案。关于我们是如何一路长途跋涉到了这里，大地上仍未来得及探索的秘密，以及无数可能的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但与此同时......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还看到了一段文明的终结，一个被时间遗弃的亡灵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g21_skystarry_L1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......时间。时间只是一个恶劣的玩笑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在足以海枯石烂，沧海桑田的时间里，我躲藏在这幽暗的地堡，重复着一件徒劳的事情——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——呼喊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的话语穿过所有的卫星与空间，每一条隧道与恒星间的夹角。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"宇宙没有对我的话给予任何回应。我向着漆黑的绝望祷告了上万年，唯一能听见的，是毁灭的回响......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"每当我渴求能得到幸存者们的回应，那些仍旧徘徊在群星之间的崩毁的声响和沦陷的光就会浮现......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是一种黑洞般的徒劳无功。远非任何拥有寿命的形体所能共情的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在无止境的寂静中，我唯一能听到的，是同胞们越来越虚弱的心跳，但休眠的他们根本不该有心跳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噩梦无法惊醒，因为我无法睡眠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我痛恨自己还拥有这些感情。我渴望像一个单纯的机械那样运作。我憎恨那些赋予我如此命运的另一个自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我深知计划已经终结。这些......“石棺”里的能源已经不足以支撑下一次复苏阶段的计划。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"随后虚无裹挟了我。无尽的，麻木......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g8_storage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"所以克丽斯腾的接触让你选择了另一次豪赌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你的同胞永远无法醒来，索性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初次见到那只人形的小动物时......我的第一感想是......惊喜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我关注着太远的深空，对地表的一切缺乏关注。我注意到了生命的成长，却从未想过他们会叩响我的门扉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我们花了许多时间交谈。尽管在现实中，不过寥寥数月。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾就像见到了真理本尊那样孜孜不倦地询问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而难能可贵的是，每一个问题都会引发她长久的反思和沉默，而不是一味地满足她的求知欲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一个想法在她的催化下诞生，但她本人并没有说出口来——克丽斯腾拒绝成为计划的执行人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"计划？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"她不是只想利用莱茵生命完成愿望吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......她认为，迟早有一天，这片大地需要一群能够脱离政治和民族团结在一起的人。这些远视主义者需要利用起身边的一切......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......搭建一艘方舟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先驱者们必将承受不被理解的烦恼，将会面临诸多分裂与苦难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但现实不是神话故事，巴别塔已经证明过了这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那罗德岛对你来说又是什么，如果你真的对这一切不抱希望的话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你说的没错。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那么让我们谈谈吧，所谓的“希望”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"克丽斯腾的小助手已经开始摆弄“石棺”的技术。我不关心，但这一定对泰拉有着至关重要的意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"妥善利用好它。克丽斯腾在政治头脑这方面确实有些瑕疵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"洛肯的研究在有效控制之内。我无法相信哥伦比亚这个国家，但梅兰德基金会的背后有一个值得交涉的对象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如此便好。然后，告诉我，远居深海之中的阿戈尔，他们真的与陆地文明天差地别吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"无论克丽斯腾告诉过您什么，我都可以说，有过之而无不及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"确实。我完全不理解身体构造并不足以在深海生存的动物为什么要建立海洋文明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但这说明他们依赖某种来自海底的产物。外力扭曲了他们的文明形态，使他们强大，也带给他们麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔是必须要团结的聚落。无论失控的——“海怪”？似乎是这么叫的——造成多大麻烦，泰拉不能离开那样一个发达的国家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"参考阿戈尔大致的地理位置，如果他们确实得到够多，利用得当，我猜测连克丽斯腾此时在做的事，在阿戈尔看来都并非遥不可及。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......力量带来傲慢。阿戈尔没那么容易被说服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"但万幸的是，因为一些偶然，我有幸与一些阿戈尔人建立了宝贵的友谊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"这将是有力的突破口。大静谧之后，阿戈尔也无法继续保持沉默了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"斯卡蒂......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"歌蕾蒂娅......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"幽灵鲨......","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"非常好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"梦魇的远征基本以传奇的形式留存在哥伦比亚的数据库内，没有像样的历史文本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但如果传说中的事迹并非弄虚作假......那他确实是个匪夷所思的英雄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使有源石作为力量的原点，这样一个暴君是如何诞生在千年前的泰拉，还能在更加原始的环境里完成如此伟业，着实令人称奇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是——南方已是一片废墟，那你们应当看向北方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你去过那里吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"乌萨斯？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"萨米？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不。是更北方的......无尽冰原的尽头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我尝试过很多次，但在力所能及的范围里，没有什么发现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但是你知道那里有什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以不要忽视留在那里的门。必要的时候，推开一扇门，会是海阔天空的景色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"即使只是推开那扇门，也远远超过了人们力所能及的范畴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就要靠你们自己想办法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大地如此宽广，文明发展至今，总不能只有一个克丽斯腾吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"您似乎比我想的还要信任这片大地上的人们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信任？我把火种给了你们。我放弃了我的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们......成功与否，都改变不了......我的失败。信任？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......是的......我不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"也许我只想看到任何能够交谈能够互相感受的生命，继续存在下去而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道。比起远在天边的难题，战争，一触即发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"即使只从哥伦比亚的眼里观察，我也能感受到，这片大地危如累卵，火随时会燃烧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你们更需要，做好准备。做你们该做的事情。是扑灭火焰，还是让火焰带来新生，这是你们的选择。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真正能够拯救泰拉人民的，永远是他们自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一觉醒的需求是亘古不变的，只因为他们全都是“人类”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"感谢你。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们会发现真相。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"天空将要被打开。但阻隔层很快就会复原。也许是几天，也许是几个月，或是几年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但泰拉人将永远把那片狭小却真实存在的光景记在眼里，将永远把月亮与更遥远的行星记在眼里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我希望......克丽斯腾希望，这会成为一个伟大的讯号。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“保存者”","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这能开启下一个时代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g7_arc_on"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，你愿意再陪我看一会星空吗？就像你过去一直做的那样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等我们下去再说这些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......星空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更确切地说，我们凝望的是阻隔层。“星荚”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有一千多米......我们所在的位置，几乎是人类能触及的极限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"电离反应太强了。在这个距离下，仪器的运行就受到了这么大的干扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"控制面板根本没有作用......我早该想到的。你并不打算让万星园坚持太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，只要能坚持到我突破阻隔层就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阻隔层......虽然我们从来倾向于选择“阻隔层”这个称呼，但你很清楚，针对它的形态，远不止“层”这一种猜想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它或许根本不是一个“层”，而是一片极为宽广的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它甚至有可能是无尽的。这六千多米——我们所认知的“正常空间”，才是“不正常”的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那种情况下，“突破”它从来就不是一个可选项。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......它确实可被突破。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你从来对此坚信不疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"6972米。从这个角度笔直地前行，只要飞出这个距离，万星园就不会再受到电离反应的干扰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好，你从那个亡灵那里得到了可信的数据。但这并没有降低探索天空的危险性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，甚至说......假设阻隔层如你所说的那般，像一层膜一样包裹住了我们所处的大地，那阻隔层之外的空间将比阻隔层本身更未知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的行动将变得更具风险。你或许会将灾难引向这片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人们根本没有做好充足的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"永远不会有足够“充分”的准备。假如灾难确实悬于头顶，那所有的人类都活在倒计时里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这样的话，我们才更应该......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......更应该谨慎一些，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，我相信......或许有一天，人们会组建一支更为完备的探索队伍，在更多数据和更为完备的支持下，走进我们眼前的深空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这同样是我希望的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你自己并不在这个由你规划的未来里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我称不上什么先驱者。关于这一点，我与你的看法依旧完全一致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可能的话......我更想成为一个起点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像曾经......我注视着那团燃烧在天幕上的火光......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我父母给我留下的最后一样东西——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——一个起点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近的逃生舱段在哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有了。能够执行返地程序的模块都已经脱离了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那抓住我。我用钙质化包裹我们两个。也许几乎没有存活的概率，试一试。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅，低头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞雷娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_896_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":"avg_npc_537_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，是你没有看脚下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g21_skystarry_L1"},{"type":"narration","text":"猝不及防的引力改变，塞雷娅只觉得脚下一空。\n她没有想到克丽斯腾会在万星园最中心的位置设置一道紧急逃生门。\n不，塞雷娅心想，自己早该想到的。这道门并不是供万星园的主人使用。克丽斯腾只是相信，在最后的时刻，塞雷娅一定会走到这里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"骤然改变的空气密度夺走了塞雷娅的声音，她什么都喊不出来。她同样知道自己已经抓不住什么，可还是伸出手去。\n星光和大地一起涌入她的视野，唯独那个人正在越来越远。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_i04"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"塞雷娅......你总是想让我好好看看这片大地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"它同样......很美丽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你会替我看着它和它所孕育的人们。我从来都知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"以前如此，以后也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而我......我并不是那个会领着人们一步步前行的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只是一双眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一双......替所有生活在这片大地上的人们，看向陌生深空的眼睛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......弗里斯顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我几乎就能看到真实的星空了......与你告诉我的相比，大概真的没有什么变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这一万多年时间......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和你，我们的文明与你们的文明......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克丽斯腾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在宇宙的尺度之下，果然还是很渺小啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"能量洪流冲击着这架空中巨构的聚能场，在如此庞大的能量之下，悬停在高空的圆环几乎被吞没。\n而紧接着，更加庞大的能量在它的中心聚焦。\n这足以摧毁任何一座巨型移动城市。\n但这片大地是如此狭小，鄙薄，它怎配承载这些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g19_1"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g17_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"汇聚的光芒舍弃大地，向更高空刺去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g17_2"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g18_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"前所未有的能量激荡下，那块从来都死气沉沉的黑幕上泛起一圈又一圈绚烂的涟漪。\n虚假的天空终于被扯碎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g19_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"亘古的双月露出真容。\n今夜，真实终于被人类首次窥见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["凯尔希"]}]}
